<title>USA: Illinova Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Illinova Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ill. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.20		    $1.18</p>
<p> Net			 91,000		   89,900</p>
<p> Revs		     458,400		  486,100</p>
